# Loaded by Next.js during `next build` (production). Committed on purpose —
# no secrets, just the deploy target that toggles basePath in next.config.ts.
#
# Why a file instead of a workflow env var? `vp run` does not forward shell/step
# env vars to the child `next build` process, but Next.js loads .env.production
# itself, so this reliably reaches next.config.ts through `vp run eva-portfolio#build`.
#
# repo `eva-site` = GitHub project page (eva813.github.io/eva-site) → needs basePath.
# When you rename to Eva813.github.io (user page, root URL), delete this file.
DEPLOY_TARGET=project
